        <detaileddescription>
<para>Validates whether the provided vertex ID corresponds specifically to the <bold>source</bold> vertex of the edge.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>EdgeType</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
